{"book":"2samuel","num":16,"verses":[{"en":"And when David was a little past the top of the hill, behold, Ziba the servant of Mephibosheth met him, with a couple of asses saddled, and upon them two hundred loaves of bread, and an hundred bunches of raisins, and an hundred of summer fruits, and a bottle of wine.","n":1,"sm":"Tavita e Semi Ua mavae atu teisi o Tavita i le tumutumu o le mauga, faauta foi, ua fetaiai ma ia o Sipa le auauna a Mefiposeta, ma asini e lua ua faanofoaina, ua faaee i o la luga o areto e lua lau, ma fuifui vine mamago e selau, ma mati mamago e potoi selau, ma le fagu pa'u o uaina.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Semi"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"teisi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tumutumu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mauga,"},{"en":"","sm":"faauta"},{"en":"","sm":"foi,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetaiai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Sipa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auauna"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Mefiposeta,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"asini"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faanofoaina,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faaee"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"luga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"areto"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lua"},{"en":"","sm":"lau,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"fuifui"},{"en":"","sm":"vine"},{"en":"","sm":"mamago"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"selau,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"mati"},{"en":"","sm":"mamago"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"potoi"},{"en":"","sm":"selau,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fagu"},{"en":"","sm":"pa'u"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina."}]},{"en":"And the king said unto Ziba, What m